codex
Premise 4 needs narrowing: `bus_pci_data_access` returns all-ones for an absent device only at register 0; other registers return zero. That means the proposed signature row cannot establish general empty-bus behavior. I also found 10 direct `bus_pci_setaddr` call sites and am checking their decoding paths.
